---
args: --set=types_pretty_printer_engine=old
---

Shared context in a higher-order function
fun (f, x: Int) { f(x) + 0 } : ((Int) -> Int, Int) -> Int
stdout : fun : ((Int) -> Int, Int) -> Int

Shared callback and final application context
fun (f)(x: Int) { f(x) + 0 } : ((Int) -> Int) -> (Int) -> Int
stdout : fun : ((Int) -> Int) -> (Int) -> Int

Shared context across a tuple
(map, id) : (((a) -> b, List a) -> List b, (c) -> c)
stdout : (fun, fun) : (((a) -> b, List a) -> List b, (c) -> c)

Type alias for an ambient thunk
typename Thunk(a) = () -> a; fun() {} : Thunk(())
stdout : fun : Thunk (())

Curried function returning an absolute thunk alias
typename Thunk(a) = [] (() -> a); fun()() {} : () -> Thunk(())
stdout : fun : () -> Thunk (())

Shared thunk alias across argument and result
typename Thunk(a) = () -> a; fun(x) { x } : (Thunk(a)) -> Thunk(a)
stdout : fun : (Thunk (a)) -> Thunk (a)
